{% call m.feat({ eyebrow: 'Age map', title: '"Wait, how old are they now?"<br>stops happening',
  shots: [ { src: shots + 'screenshot-groups.webp', alt: 'AgeMap main — person cards by age with the group panel', w: 720, h: 1542 } ] }) %}
  <p>Your contacts app stores names and phone numbers, not the things you actually want to know. AgeMap places everyone on one screen by age — oldest at the top, youngest at the bottom.</p>
  <ul class="checks">
    <li><strong>Pinch</strong> to change how many people fit, <strong>drag</strong> to pan</li>
    <li><strong>Tap</strong> a card and the details slide up from the bottom</li>
    <li><strong>Group colors</strong> and a group filter for family, friends, work</li>
  </ul>
{% endcall %}

{% call m.feat({ eyebrow: 'Family tree', title: 'Set the relationships,<br>the tree draws itself', soft: true, flip: true,
  shots: [ { src: shots + 'screenshot-family-tree.webp', alt: 'AgeMap family tree — generations arranged automatically', w: 720, h: 1542 } ] }) %}
  <p>Grandparents → Parents → Self → Children → Grandchildren stack top to bottom, and the connecting lines are drawn automatically. One tap at the top switches between the age map and the tree.</p>
  <ul class="checks">
    <li><strong>Parent–child</strong>, <strong>siblings</strong>, <strong>romantic partners</strong></li>
    <li><strong>Spouse</strong> — current and former spouses tracked separately</li>
    <li>Set the relationship <strong>once</strong> from the detail screen</li>
  </ul>
{% endcall %}

{% call m.feat({ eyebrow: 'Birthday reminders', title: 'Never miss<br>the birthdays that matter',
  shots: [ { src: shots + 'screenshot-birthday.webp', alt: 'Upcoming birthdays list and reminder settings', w: 720, h: 1542 } ] }) %}
  <p>Push notifications arrive at the time you set, in four steps so you get exactly the heads-up you need. Turn on all four or only the ones you want.</p>
  <ul class="checks">
    <li><strong>D-30</strong> gift · <strong>D-7</strong> plans · <strong>D-1</strong> greeting · <strong>D-day</strong></li>
    <li>Arrives <strong>at the set time</strong> even when the app is closed</li>
    <li><strong>Lunar birthdays</strong> are converted to solar so they fire on the right day</li>
  </ul>
{% endcall %}

{% call m.feat({ eyebrow: 'Moments', title: '"What did I give them<br>last year?"', soft: true, flip: true,
  shots: [ { src: shots + 'screenshot-moments.webp', alt: 'Moments organized by year — gifts given and received', w: 720, h: 1542 } ] }) %}
  <p>Jot it down in the Moments section on the person's detail screen and it stacks up neatly, year by year.</p>
  <ul class="checks">
    <li><strong>Given vs. received</strong>, tracked separately</li>
    <li>🎁 Gift · 💰 Cash · ❤️ Heart · 🎂 Cake · 💌 Letter <strong>icons</strong> and photo attachments</li>
    <li>Shared memories with that person <strong>on a timeline</strong></li>
  </ul>
{% endcall %}

{% call m.feat({ eyebrow: 'Person details', title: 'Age is just<br>the start',
  shots: [ { src: shots + 'screenshot-person-detail.webp', alt: 'Person details — precise age, zodiac, birthstone, oriental zodiac', w: 720, h: 1542 } ] }) %}
  <p>The person detail screen also surfaces the things you naturally want to know next.</p>
  <ul class="checks">
    <li><strong>Precise age</strong> — "44 years, 3 months, 17 days", plus a countdown to the next birthday</li>
    <li><strong>Zodiac sign · Birthstone · Oriental zodiac</strong> — from the date of birth</li>
    <li><strong>"Me" marker</strong> — appear in every group as a reference point</li>
  </ul>
{% endcall %}

{% call m.more('See all features', 'Groups · Backup & restore · Controls · Why') %}
  <div>
    <h4>Groups</h4>
    <ul>
      <li>Family, Friends, Work, Hobby — any group with a color; cards on the map show in that color</li>
      <li>Multiple memberships — one person in several groups at once</li>
      <li>Group filter — right-panel checkboxes to show only the groups you want</li>
      <li>Preset group templates, and drag groups you check often to the top</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div>
    <h4>Backup &amp; restore</h4>
    <ul>
      <li>People, groups, relationships, profile photos, moments and notification settings in one ZIP</li>
      <li>The filename is auto-generated as agemap_backup_DATE.zip</li>
      <li>Move to a new device — back up → send via Google Drive or email → restore</li>
      <li>Keep the backup in Google Drive or email and you're covered against device loss</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div>
    <h4>Controls and input</h4>
    <ul>
      <li>Pinch, drag, tap; one tap at the top switches to family tree mode</li>
      <li>Lunar birthday switch converts to solar; reminders still fire on the correct solar date</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div>
    <h4>Why AgeMap</h4>
    <ul>
      <li>No more doing the math — how old is your niece now, how many years until your parents turn 60?</li>
      <li>Family and relative connections stop blurring in your head</li>
      <li>Birthdays you care about stop slipping past</li>
      <li>You remember which gifts you've already given</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
{% endcall %}

